This is one of the most important requirements.

Create at least **80 complete, usable questions before launch**, not just 80 placeholders.

| Category | Initial minimum |
|---|---:|
| Cricket and cricket preferences | 20 |
| Commercial aviation and aircraft | 20 |
| Advik's personal likes, food and habits | 20 |
| Cricket + aviation combinations and funny scenarios | 20 |
